            <ArticleTitle>Calcific aortic stenosis and statin therapy: a new insight.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>275-6; author reply 276-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Considering the molecular similarities between calcific aortic stenosis and atherosclerosis, we would like to highlight the potential benefit of statin therapy after balloon aortic valvuloplasty to delay restenosis in patients awaiting a percutaneous heart valve implantation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
